#
# PC de H cubico, a = 3.5 Angstrom -- reproduz o sistema-brinquedo da
# Fig. 1 do artigo (Quan, Rybin, Scheffler, Carbogno, PRB 113, 085112
# (2026)). Leve de proposito (1 atomo, base s-only): serve so' para
# validar o pipeline de unfolding com M nao-diagonal, nao para fisica
# realista.
#
System.CurrentDirectory        ./
System.Name                    pc_H
level.of.stdout                 1
level.of.fileout                 1
HS.fileout                     on

Species.Number       1
<Definition.of.Atomic.Species
  H   H5.0-s1     H_CA19
Definition.of.Atomic.Species>

Atoms.Number         1
Atoms.SpeciesAndCoordinates.Unit  Ang
<Atoms.SpeciesAndCoordinates
  1  H   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000   0.5  0.5
Atoms.SpeciesAndCoordinates>

Atoms.UnitVectors.Unit             Ang
<Atoms.UnitVectors
  3.500000   0.000000   0.000000
  0.000000   3.500000   0.000000
  0.000000   0.000000   3.500000
Atoms.UnitVectors>

scf.EigenvalueSolver         Band
scf.XcType                  LDA
scf.SpinPolarization        off
scf.ElectronicTemperature   300.0
scf.energycutoff            100.0
scf.Kgrid                   8 8 8
scf.Mixing.Type              rmm-diis
scf.criterion                1.0e-7
scf.maxIter                  100

Band.dispersion              off
